#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.1.0.rst:94
msgid ""
"**Frame buffer source selector and format readout** -- choose the streaming "
"sensor on multi-sensor cameras, or Off; the received frame format is shown "
"in the pane's title; the JPG toggle is now a JPG Mode / RAW Mode selector "
"(`e76284bde9e <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/e76284bde9e>`__, "
"`c2baff8d60c <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/c2baff8d60c>`__, "
