msgstr "Versiunea **OpenMV IDE** a fost ridicată la 5.1.0."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v5.1.0.rst:287
msgid ""
"**Bundled firmware:** v5.0.1 (see the :doc:`firmware changelog "
